html='''<!doctype html><html lang="en"><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width"><title>KIRA-9 sustain correction</title><style>body{font:18px system-ui;background:#121827;color:#eef1ff;max-width:760px;margin:30px auto;padding:20px}section{background:#202b43;padding:18px;margin:20px 0;border-radius:12px}audio,textarea,select{width:100%;font:inherit;margin:10px 0}textarea{min-height:70px}button{font:inherit;padding:12px}</style><h1>Four short sustain comparisons</h1><p>This tests one isolated correction to sustained vowels. Each pair contains one preserved reference and one new version; order is hidden. Both are0.4seconds at the same source pitch, listening level and sample rate. Replay as needed. No effects. No need to repeat the word or stage tests.</p><p>Judge natural human character and the underlying artificial tone. This does not establish word intelligibility or firmware acceptance.</p>ROWS<button id="export">Download four judgments</button><script>document.getElementById('export').onclick=()=>{const responses=[...document.querySelectorAll('section')].map(s=>({id:s.id,more_human:s.querySelector('select').value,observations:s.querySelector('textarea').value}));if(responses.some(x=>!x.more_human)){alert('Choose a judgment for each pair.');return}const u=URL.createObjectURL(new Blob([JSON.stringify({protocol:'kira-multigrain-pairs-v1',responses},null,2)],{type:'application/json'})),a=document.createElement('a');a.href=u;a.download='KIRA9-multigrain-observations.json';a.click();setTimeout(()=>URL.revokeObjectURL(u),1000)};</script><details><summary>Recording notice</summary><pre style="white-space:pre-wrap">NOTICE</pre></details></html>'''
